---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Newsletter from '../components/Newsletter.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title={`About — ${SITE_TITLE}`}
      description="Who we are and why we drag a vegan toddler around the world."
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <div class="container prose section">
        <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
        <h1>Hi, we're the family behind the tiny vegan.</h1>
        <p>
          <em
            >[Your story goes here — this placeholder shows the shape of a
            good about page.]</em
          >
        </p>
        <p>
          We're a vegan family who refused to accept that having a toddler
          means eating at the hotel buffet forever. Since our kid could sit
          in a carrier we've been hunting down the best plant-based food,
          the friendliest cafés, and the neighborhoods where a stroller and
          good taste can coexist.
        </p>
        <p>
          Everything on this site is field-tested: every restaurant was
          eaten at, every flight survived, every snack spilled on. No
          press-trip fluff — if a city was hard, we say so.
        </p>
        <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Destination guides for vegan families, city by city</li>
          <li>Flight and packing playbooks that actually work</li>
          <li>Supermarket cheat sheets: accidentally-vegan snacks by country</li>
          <li>The good coffee, always</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Say hi</h2>
        <p>
          The fastest way to reach us is Instagram, or reply to any email
          from the newsletter. We read everything.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>
    <Newsletter />
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
